suppress.notes:
CVE-2026-47884 (XsltView RCE): not exploitable. Requires XsltView with a /** view mapping;
            this app is REST-only (no ViewResolver, ModelAndView, or XsltView usage). No 6.2.x fix exists;
            patched only in Spring Framework 7.0.9 / Spring Boot 4. Remove on Boot 4 migration.

CVE-2026-104849 (tinypool prototype pollution): build-time only (Docusaurus SSG in website/),
            not shipped code. Exploit requires pool.run(task, options) without an own filename property;
            @docusaurus/core calls pool.run(task) single-arg, which the advisory states is unaffected.
            No 1.x fix; 2.1.2 is a major bump outside docusaurus's ^1.0.2 range. Remove when docusaurus
            migrates to tinypool 2.x.
